  "label": "text maps to hand gesture",
  "description": "The text 'now i'm gonna use two fingers' is mapped onto the visual material of the hand making a peace sign (two fingers raised). The text explicitly refers to the literal action depicted by the hand gesture, creating an analogical mapping where the textual phrase 'use two fingers' is understood as referring to the visual representation of the same action. This mapping is direct and literal, as the hand gesture visually embodies the phrase's meaning.",
